    "detailed_description": "Police Station Simulator is a renovation and micro-management game, which doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously.<br><br>The mayor of Twin Pigs put you in charge of a run-down police station. It is now up to you to restore it to its former glory. Are you up to the task, or is the Twin Pigs Police Department doomed forever?<br><br>Arm yourself with some coffee and donuts, because there's a lot of work ahead!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/352f427bf54b0711fc47d04e465928d2.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/352f427bf54b0711fc47d04e465928d2.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Every corner of the station begs for your attention after years of neglect. Take out the trash, scrub the floors, and replace broken furniture. Summon your inner perfectionist and hyper-focus on cleaning until the whole precinct shines brighter than a freshly polished badge!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8ea5e4daeed4363235d46f1f391bdfe1.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8ea5e4daeed4363235d46f1f391bdfe1.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Browse through available employees and recruit officers with sets of skills that suit your current needs (or budget). Will they thrive and grow under your command? Or will they crack and crumble away, one by one?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/63fbdf36e9e3ccfa666dec8072ae3eaa.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/63fbdf36e9e3ccfa666dec8072ae3eaa.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Receive crime reports, create new cases, and assign them to your available officers. Equip your chosen team with the right tools for the job and ensure their car is in working order before they hit the streets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8cc2c4b35449f7070a8dc10756cc5d81.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8cc2c4b35449f7070a8dc10756cc5d81.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>A team that snacks together, sticks together! Buy donuts and coffee for your police officers to keep the morale up during the hardest of cases. Make sure the work environment is clean, safe, and provides at least some semblance of entertainment.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/0a8a58d24d78ed7cc591adbc54022979.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/0a8a58d24d78ed7cc591adbc54022979.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Print, fill, sign, stamp, repeat. To maximize the funds you get from the mayor of Twin Pigs, you need to ensure that all of your hard-earned successes are well documented. As the mayor says: misplaced files mean misplaced funds!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/f6cc040a5e71987924f879499ba99b0f.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/f6cc040a5e71987924f879499ba99b0f.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>You can use the acquired money to expand the station and unlock new features necessary to complete more complex cases.<br>\u2026Or you can spend everything on fancy decorations and repaint all of the walls pink - nothing is stopping you from spending the public funds however you like.<br><br>It\u2019s your game, so enjoy it in any way you want. The Twin Pigs Police Department awaits your orders!",
    "about_the_game": "Police Station Simulator is a renovation and micro-management game, which doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously.<br><br>The mayor of Twin Pigs put you in charge of a run-down police station. It is now up to you to restore it to its former glory. Are you up to the task, or is the Twin Pigs Police Department doomed forever?<br><br>Arm yourself with some coffee and donuts, because there's a lot of work ahead!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/352f427bf54b0711fc47d04e465928d2.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/352f427bf54b0711fc47d04e465928d2.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Every corner of the station begs for your attention after years of neglect. Take out the trash, scrub the floors, and replace broken furniture. Summon your inner perfectionist and hyper-focus on cleaning until the whole precinct shines brighter than a freshly polished badge!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8ea5e4daeed4363235d46f1f391bdfe1.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8ea5e4daeed4363235d46f1f391bdfe1.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Browse through available employees and recruit officers with sets of skills that suit your current needs (or budget). Will they thrive and grow under your command? Or will they crack and crumble away, one by one?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/63fbdf36e9e3ccfa666dec8072ae3eaa.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/63fbdf36e9e3ccfa666dec8072ae3eaa.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Receive crime reports, create new cases, and assign them to your available officers. Equip your chosen team with the right tools for the job and ensure their car is in working order before they hit the streets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8cc2c4b35449f7070a8dc10756cc5d81.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/8cc2c4b35449f7070a8dc10756cc5d81.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>A team that snacks together, sticks together! Buy donuts and coffee for your police officers to keep the morale up during the hardest of cases. Make sure the work environment is clean, safe, and provides at least some semblance of entertainment.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/0a8a58d24d78ed7cc591adbc54022979.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/0a8a58d24d78ed7cc591adbc54022979.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Print, fill, sign, stamp, repeat. To maximize the funds you get from the mayor of Twin Pigs, you need to ensure that all of your hard-earned successes are well documented. As the mayor says: misplaced files mean misplaced funds!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/f6cc040a5e71987924f879499ba99b0f.poster.avif?t=1747390038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155140/extras/f6cc040a5e71987924f879499ba99b0f.webm?t=1747390038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>You can use the acquired money to expand the station and unlock new features necessary to complete more complex cases.<br>\u2026Or you can spend everything on fancy decorations and repaint all of the walls pink - nothing is stopping you from spending the public funds however you like.<br><br>It\u2019s your game, so enjoy it in any way you want. The Twin Pigs Police Department awaits your orders!",
